# This repo is PUBLIC (it serves hormonelog's privacy policy and terms) and had no
# .gitignore at all until 2026-10-01. The portfolio secrets sweep found it clean --
# all three tracked files are static HTML -- but a public repo with no ignore rules
# is one stray `git add -A` away from publishing whatever is sitting in the folder.
#
# Real credentials live in the macOS Keychain (`jarvis/<name>`) or
# ~/.config/jarvis/keys/ per rules 6 and 7. None of them belong in any tree.

# --- credentials: never commit ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.p8
*.p12
*.pem
*.jks
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision
*service-account*.json

# --- os / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.log

# --- dependencies / build output ---
# Both spellings, deliberately. `node_modules/` matches a DIRECTORY only, so a
# SYMLINK named node_modules -- which is how a git worktree borrows the main
# checkout's install -- slips straight past it and gets committed by `git add -A`.
node_modules/
node_modules
